  "title": "Can EMDR Be Integrated with Christian Counseling?",
  "sourceUrl": "",
  "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1768844138397\" id=\"item-696e6b348822851ff6c58f0d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/f2f33f3e-f102-4470-9086-4fff458f9fa4_912/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"85c2db4dda00f60e4143\" id=\"block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Many clients want emotional healing that honors their faith. EMDR and Christian counseling can work together beautifully.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/news/2026/1/18/emdr-therapy-for-trauma-and-ptsd-in-tyler-tx\"><strong>EMDR Therapy for Trauma and PTSD in Tyler, TX</strong></a></p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Faith and Neuroscience</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">EMDR works with how God designed the brain to heal. Faith and science are not in conflict — they complement each other.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">How Faith Is Integrated</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Faith integration may include:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Prayer (client-led)</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Spiritual grounding</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Exploring faith-related wounds</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Reframing beliefs with truth and grace</p></li></ul><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Whole-Person Healing</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At The Bridge, healing addresses <strong>mind, body, and spirit</strong>.</p><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Faith-Based EMDR in Tyler, TX</h2><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">👉 <a href=\"/schedule-an-apointment\"><strong>Contact The Bridge Therapeutic Services</strong></a> to learn more about faith-integrated EMDR therapy.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-85c2db4dda00f60e4143 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
